{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":74,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"d","content":["Maschil of Asaph. "]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 74:1"},"O God, why hast thou cast us off for ever? ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["why"]}," doth thine anger smoke against the sheep of thy pasture? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 74:2"},"Remember thy congregation, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which"]}," thou hast purchased of old; the rod of thine inheritance, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which"]}," thou hast redeemed; this mount Zion, wherein thou hast dwelt. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 74:3"},"Lift up thy feet unto the perpetual desolations; ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["even"]}," all ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," the enemy hath done wickedly in the sanctuary. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 74:4"},"Thine enemies roar in the midst of thy congregations; they set up their ensigns ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["for"]}," signs. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 74:5"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["A man"]}," was famous according as he had lifted up axes upon the thick trees. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 74:6"},"But now they break down the carved work thereof at once with axes and hammers. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 74:7"},"They have cast fire into thy sanctuary, they have defiled ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["by casting down"]}," the dwelling place of thy name to the ground. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 74:8"},"They said in their hearts, Let us destroy them together: they have burned up all the synagogues of God in the land. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:8"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PSA 74:9"},"We see not our signs: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," no more any prophet: neither ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is there"]}," among us any that knoweth how long. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:9"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PSA 74:10"},"O God, how long shall the adversary reproach? shall the enemy blaspheme thy name for ever? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:10"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PSA 74:11"},"Why withdrawest thou thy hand, even thy right hand? pluck ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it "]},"out of thy bosom. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:11"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PSA 74:12"},"For God ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," my King of old, working salvation in the midst of the earth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:12"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PSA 74:13"},"Thou didst divide the sea by thy strength: thou brakest the heads of the dragons in the waters. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:13"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PSA 74:14"},"Thou brakest the heads of leviathan in pieces, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," gavest him ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["to be"]}," meat to the people inhabiting the wilderness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:14"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PSA 74:15"},"Thou didst cleave the fountain and the flood: thou driedst up mighty rivers. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:15"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PSA 74:16"},"The day ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," thine, the night also ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," thine: thou hast prepared the light and the sun. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:16"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PSA 74:17"},"Thou hast set all the borders of the earth: thou hast made summer and winter. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:17"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PSA 74:18"},"Remember this, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," the enemy hath reproached, O LORD, and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," the foolish people have blasphemed thy name. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:18"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PSA 74:19"},"O deliver not the soul of thy turtledove unto the multitude ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["of the wicked:"]}," forget not the congregation of thy poor for ever. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:19"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PSA 74:20"},"Have respect unto the covenant: for the dark places of the earth are full of the habitations of cruelty. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:20"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PSA 74:21"},"O let not the oppressed return ashamed: let the poor and needy praise thy name. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:21"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PSA 74:22"},"Arise, O God, plead thine own cause: remember how the foolish man reproacheth thee daily. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:22"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PSA 74:23"},"Forget not the voice of thine enemies: the tumult of those that rise up against thee increaseth continually. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 74:23"}]}]}
